# DOORS: the squad works the door nearest the nearest man who is not theirs: stacks on it and is told to go, falls back in, then
# one pair stacks and bangs its way in while the other holds the threshold and clears from outside; and again, on whichever door
# is nearest him by then.
# REACHES: the stack order and its places, the word to go, the door tools (open and clear, bang and clear, the threshold held),
# entries and the room fight behind them, shutting a door, the fall-in order. The tool says, a floor, which of these lines the
# game never took there and why.
# DOES NOT REACH: a charge on a door or a wall, the wand, the throws' page, a pair's orders, Sam's gun.
unhurt
every 24 from 1    order stack door all
every 24 from 6    order go door all
every 24 from 12   order fallIn sam all
every 24 from 14   order stack door red
every 24 from 18   order bangClear door red
every 48 from 20   order thresholdHold door blue
every 48 from 22   order openClear door blue
every 48 from 40   order shutDoor door all
